From: ReiKatari <reikatari@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:10:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/10] turnip: Fix OneUI UBWC 5.0 swapchain framebuffer corruption

Clamp pitch stride and disable lossy UBWC on external swapchain images
for Samsung Galaxy S24/S25 Ultra (Adreno 750 / 830).
---
 src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc
index 3456789..0abcdef 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc
+++ b/src/freedreno/vulkan/tu_image.cc
@@ -210,6 +210,12 @@ tu_image_init(struct tu_device *device, struct tu_image *image,
       if (image->vk.tiling == VK_IMAGE_TILING_OPTIMAL) {
          image->layout[0].ubwc = true;
+         if (device->instance->oneui_ubwc_fix) {
+            image->layout[0].pitch = align(image->layout[0].pitch, 128);
+            image->layout[0].ubwc_flags |= FD_UBWC_ALIGN_5_0;
+         }
       }
